          "context": "Unverified contact, first 3 s of the call: the badge reads “Not verified” in a glass capsule. After 3 s the capsule narrows onto the shield (spring, response 0.5, damping 0.92) while the words fade and blur out ahead of the edge; the shield never moves. It stays open while its popover is up, and closes 3 s after the popover goes.",
