              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Sheets become centred form sheets without a grabber (540 pt wide; small ones keep 374 pt). Context menus dim both columns. The attach panel sits above its button. The in-app banner is centred on the window, 374 pt wide.",
